"evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240723","date":"2024-07-23","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905818494","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905818494","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-07-23","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623","date":"2024-06-23","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":3,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905929894","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905929894","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-06-23","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-307-b-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623","date":"2024-06-23","original_code":"746.307(b)(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-07-23","finding":"Parental Communication - Situation that Placed a Child at Risk: Based on the information gathered during the investigation, it has been determined that the school failed to report immediately to the parents that a child had been involved in any on-routine situation that placed, or may have placed, the child at risk for injury or harm when released to a person that was not designated to pick up. The child was out of operation's supervision and with this undesignated person for 17 minutes plus 3 minutes in addition since the school changing child. A total of 20 minutes passed before parents were contacted.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026680638","violation_type_title":"Parental Communication - Situation that Placed a Child at Risk (26 TAC §746.307(b)(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1201-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623","date":"2024-06-23","original_code":"746.1201(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-07-23","finding":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control: Based on the information gathered during the investigation, it has been determined staff did not demonstrate good judgment when staff did not verify identity of the person at pick up which resulted in someone taking the wrong child.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026680171","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control (26 TAC §746.1201(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1205-a-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1283060-i20240623","date":"2024-06-23","original_code":"746.1205(a)(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-07-23","finding":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity: Based on the information gathered during the investigation, it has been determined that child was left unattended, and caregiver was not at a physical proximity which did not allow visual and/or auditory awareness of the child in care for 17 minutes.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026694629","violation_type_title":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity (26 TAC §746.1205(a)(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-h